    "description": "A rare opportunity, 2119-2121 Pierce is a contemporary 2-unit residence located on an incredibly desirable block in Pacific Heights. This quiet non-through-street address is remarkably convenient and is about one half block from Alta Plaza Park and just over two blocks from one of San Francisco's premier retail and dining corridors: Fillmore Street. The top unit has 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. The bottom unit is a two-level 4 bedroom 3 bathroom with a versatile bottom bedroom that can also be used as a media room/flex space/2nd living area. With bedrooms and baths at the rear, both units have ideal layouts and flow. Large chef's kitchens open to the wide well-scaled front living and dining areas with natural light captured by oversized double-pane bay windows. Both units have hardwood flooring throughout and private in-unit laundry. There is a deck off the rear of the upper unit and a charming garden below. Completing this exceptional fully vacant property is a 2 car tandem garage with multiple additional storage closets."
  },
